model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-05-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 R12 (#196): a statement known window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-20), read as known 2026-04-10, holds bank[r1] fulfilling pay[2026-03]. Item B6: one movement either way (b6_count: 1), its amount the hole (b6_flows), next the hole and never RUN-TIE (b6_next); P70: the hole names (bank[r1], st) (p70); no-item 1, covered is the hole (cov, cov_each: true, then false); no-item 2, a count of the observed input's rows is the hole (rows)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known window(2026-04-01, 2026-04-20)
  covers konto
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-03, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 7.00 PLN, fulfils: pay[2026-03]) "r"

ask b6_count: count(t in transfers over 2026-03) as known 2026-04-10
ask b6_flows: flows(pay, 2026-03) as known 2026-04-10
ask b6_next: next(transfers, 2026-03-01) as known 2026-04-10
ask p70: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) as known 2026-04-10
ask cov: covered(konto, 2026-03) as known 2026-04-10
ask cov_each: covered(konto, 2026-03) as known 2026-04-10 windows each
ask rows: count(o in bank over 2026-03) as known 2026-04-10
ask after: count(o in bank over 2026-03), covered(konto, 2026-03) as known 2026-04-25
